reports/

# Helm chart templates are Go-template-flavoured YAML, not plain YAML —
# `{{- if .Values.x }}`/`{{ include "..." }}` are not valid YAML tokens, so
# Prettier's YAML parser throws a SyntaxError on every file under here
# (found by actually running `pnpm verify` against the chart, not assumed).
# `helm lint`/`helm template` (scripts/verify-chart.sh) are this content's
# real format/correctness gates. values*.yaml and Chart.yaml are plain YAML
# with no template syntax and are deliberately NOT excluded — they stay
# Prettier-formatted like every other YAML file in the repo.
infra/helm/*/templates/
